      "message": "[Gerrit AI Review] ✅ **Approved** — All checks pass. [[trajectory](https://goto.corp.google.com/traj/a17c4f71-17e2-4e43-be2b-6aa729661167)]\n\n### Review Summary\n*   **Functionality:** Cortex-M33 (ARMv8-M) MPU support is correctly implemented. The mechanism to lock the rollback region by disabling the MPU region (relying on `CONFIG_MPU_DISABLE_BACKGROUND_MAP\u003dy` for protection) is logically sound and well-documented.\n*   **Architecture \u0026 Component Fit:** The implementation integrates well with Zephyr\u0027s ARM CMSE MPU API.\n*   **Code Simplicity:** Clean use of `arm_cmse_mpu_region_get` avoiding redundant loops.\n*   **Idiomaticity \u0026 Readability:** Code adheres to Zephyr configuration patterns. Hardware-specific design choices are well-documented inline.\n*   **Security:** Rollback region protections are properly configured.\n*   **Testing:** `TEST\u003dnone` is justified under the Hardware/Physical Exception since MPU register mutations are hardware-dependent and cannot be generically tested in software.\n*   **CL Size \u0026 Scope:** Size: M (+125, -2). The CL is appropriately scoped to adding Cortex-M33 MPU support.\n*   **Commit Message:** The message concisely explains the why and what, and includes required `BUG` and `TEST` footers.",
